&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solliciteer bij TheFork en bouw mee aan onze culinaire missie! 💚&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bij TheFork geloven we dat de mooiste momenten in het leven plaatsvinden aan tafel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als toonaangevend restaurantreserveringsplatform in Europa verbinden we de grootste community van loyale gasten met de favoriete restaurants van over de hele wereld. Gedreven door innovatie en een diepe passie voor de restaurantsector creëren we unieke eetervaringen in 11 landen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We maken deel uit van de Tripadvisor Group en zijn trots op een diverse, mensgerichte cultuur waarin onze waarden &lt;strong&gt;respect, eigenaarschap, groei en samen sterker&lt;/strong&gt; centraal staan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ben jij gepassioneerd door eten, technologie en het maken van echte impact? &lt;strong&gt;Jouw plek aan tafel staat klaar.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.careers.thefork.com/&quot;&gt; Ontdek het leven bij TheFork&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nadat je de restaurants binnen jouw gebied hebt geselecteerd, neem je proactief contact op met eigenaren en managers om afspraken in te plannen. Je dagelijkse werkzaamheden bestaan uit &lt;strong&gt;cold calling, bezoeken aan restaurants en vooraf ingeplande afspraken&lt;/strong&gt;, waarin je de producten en diensten van TheFork presenteert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent verantwoordelijk voor het &lt;strong&gt;adviseren en verkopen van TheFork-producten en -diensten&lt;/strong&gt;, waaronder promoties, geavanceerde softwaretools, reserveringswidgets voor restaurantwebsites en marketingoplossingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je gaat in gesprek met restaurantmanagers om hen te helpen de mogelijkheden, functies en voordelen van &lt;strong&gt;TheFork Manager&lt;/strong&gt; en het TheFork-netwerk te begrijpen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je begeleidt prospects gedurende het volledige salesproces, van het eerste contact tot het sluiten van de deal en het succesvol online publiceren van het restaurant op TheFork en aangesloten websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie ben jij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dit zijn de belangrijkste vereisten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je spreekt &lt;strong&gt;vloeiend Nederlands&lt;/strong&gt; en hebt een goede beheersing van het Engels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent &lt;strong&gt;zelfstandig, resultaatgericht&lt;/strong&gt; en gemotiveerd om targets te behalen en te overtreffen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent klant- en salesgericht en beschikt over sterke &lt;strong&gt;overtuigings- en beïnvloedingsvaardigheden&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent een commercieel sterke professional met aantoonbare saleservaring en voelt je comfortabel bij het &lt;strong&gt;sluiten van deals tijdens één gesprek&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt ervaring in &lt;strong&gt;business development&lt;/strong&gt;, bij voorkeur binnen B2B of de restaurant-/hospitalitysector, en bent sterk in onderhandelingen op korte termijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dit is mooi meegenomen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent een echte &lt;strong&gt;foodie&lt;/strong&gt; met een sterke interesse in digitale producten, technologie en de restaurantsector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent dynamisch, zelfstandig en voelt je thuis in een snel veranderende omgeving. Je bent daarnaast goed georganiseerd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent nieuwsgierig, leergierig en gemotiveerd om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen binnen je rol.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je weet &lt;strong&gt;AI effectief in te zetten&lt;/strong&gt; om je prestaties naar een hoger niveau te tillen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij jou?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😄 Een geweldig team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ Een flexibele werkomgeving (&lt;strong&gt;2 dagen per week thuiswerken&lt;/strong&gt;, plus de mogelijkheid om gedurende de zomerperiode en in december in totaal maximaal 4 extra weken volledig op afstand te werken)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 Een competitief vast salaris en bonus + &lt;strong&gt;auto van de zaak&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Internationale teams en een multiculturele werkomgeving verspreid over &lt;strong&gt;10 kantoren in Europa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 Een zeer inclusieve werkomgeving&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤸‍♀️ Lifestyle benefits die je kunt gebruiken voor het vergoeden van kosten rondom &lt;strong&gt;sport en vrije tijd, gezinsondersteuning, reizen&lt;/strong&gt; en meer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 Continue mogelijkheden voor &lt;strong&gt;leren en persoonlijke ontwikkeling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😌 Gratis toegang tot de &lt;strong&gt;Calm-app&lt;/strong&gt; om je veerkracht te versterken en je mentale welzijn te ondersteunen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🐣 Een uitgebreid beleid voor &lt;strong&gt;ouderschaps- en mantelzorgverlof&lt;/strong&gt; (12 weken volledig betaald)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👩‍🦽 &lt;strong&gt;Levens- en arbeidsongeschiktheidsverzekering&lt;/strong&gt; zonder kosten voor de werknemer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👴 Aantrekkelijke &lt;strong&gt;pensioenregeling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 Geweldige kantoren met catering, een koffiecorner op iedere verdieping en ontspanningsruimtes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎤 Leuke &lt;strong&gt;teambuildingactiviteiten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alle sollicitaties verlopen via onze careers-site en officiële e-mail. We sturen geen berichten via sms en vragen nooit om betalingen tijdens het sollicitatieproces. Meld verdachte berichten onmiddellijk.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wij geloven dat we samen sterker staan en verwelkomen iedereen zoals die is. We streven ernaar om ervoor te zorgen dat iedereen – ongeacht beperking, leeftijd, sociaal-economische of culturele achtergrond, etniciteit, geloof, gender, genderexpressie, genderidentiteit, ideologie, afkomst, ras, seksuele oriëntatie, burgerlijke staat of enig ander kenmerk dat wettelijk beschermd is – de kans krijgt om zijn of haar volledige potentieel te bereiken. Bij TheFork vinden we het belangrijk dat je jouw unieke perspectieven en ervaringen meebrengt, zodat we samen de restaurantsector kunnen blijven vernieuwen en van goed naar geweldig kunnen gaan.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TheFork zet zich in voor een eerlijk en toegankelijk recruitmentproces. Heb je vanwege een gezondheidsconditie of beperking extra ondersteuning nodig tijdens je sollicitatie, interview of deelname aan het selectieproces? Neem dan contact op via AccessibleRecruitment@TheFork.com. Ons HR-team beoordeelt je verzoek en neemt vervolgens contact met je op.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LL-MA1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Movement and Champion Restaurant Culture! 💚&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TheFork we believe that the best things in life happen around the table. &lt;br&gt;As the leading restaurant booking platform in Europe, we connect the broadest community of loyal diners with the world’s favorite restaurants. Powered by innovation and a deep passion for the restaurant industry, we create unique dining experiences across 11 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re part of the Tripadvisor Group and proud to be building a diverse, people-first culture where “respect”, “ownership”, “growth” and “better together” values thrive. &lt;br&gt;If you’re passionate about food, technology, and making a real impact, your seat at the table is ready.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.careers.thefork.com&quot;&gt; Discover life at TheFork&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;After selecting in-scope restaurants, you will proactively contact and schedule meetings with the owners or managers of the restaurants. Your daily activities will be composed of cold-calls, walk-in visits and pre organized meetings to present TheFork products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be in charge of proposing and selling TheFork products and services, including: promotions, advanced software tool, booking widgets installed on the restaurant website, training &amp;amp; marketing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will engage with the Restaurants managers to help them understand the opportunities, features and benefits of the TheFork Manager tool and TheFork network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will follow up with the prospects you engaged with until you close the deal and the restaurant is successfully published online on TheFork and affiliate websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Must Meet These Critical Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You speak Dutch fluently, and have a good command of English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-driven, results-oriented, and passionate about achieving and exceeding targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are customer- and sales-oriented with persuasive and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-performing professional with proven sales experience, comfortable closing deals in a single call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in business development, preferably in B2B or restaurants/hospitality environments, and are skilled in short-term negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Can Impress With These Additions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a foodie with a strong interest in digital, tech products, and the restaurant sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are dynamic, independent, and thrive in fast-paced environments with excellent organisational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious, eager to learn, and motivated to grow in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in using AI as a tool to perform even better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we offer you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😄 An awesome team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏠 A permanent contract&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ Flexible working environment (2 days home office per week +&amp;nbsp; up to 4 total weeks additional flexibility during the summer period and in December to work fully remotely)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 Competitive fixed salary and bonus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍕 Lunches will be provided at the office for you to enjoy with your colleagues&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 International teams and a multicultural environment spanning 10 offices across Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝Highly inclusive working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤸‍♀️ Lifestyle benefits that can be used to reimburse&amp;nbsp; expenses related to physical and leisure activities, family support, travel etc&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 Continuous learning and development programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😌 Free access to the Calm app to help you build resilience wherever you are&amp;nbsp; in your mental health journey&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🐣Dedicated parental leave and caregiver leave policies (12 weeks fully paid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👩‍🦽 Life &amp;amp; Disability Insurance at no cost to the employee&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👴 Attractive pension plans&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 Amazing offices with dining, a coffee point on each floor, and leisure area&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎤 Team building events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All hiring happens through our careers site and official email. We do not text or ask for payment during the hiring process. Please report any suspicious messages immediately.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that we are better together, and we welcome you for who you are. We endeavor to ensure&amp;nbsp; that everyone - regardless of ability, age, socio-economic &amp;amp; cultural background, ethnicity, faith, gender, gender expression, gender identity, ideology, national origin, race, sexual orientation, marital status, or any characteristic protected under&amp;nbsp; applicable law -has the opportunity to reach their full potential. At TheFork, we want you to bring us your unique perspectives and experiences, so we can collectively continue disrupting the restaurant industry and go from good to great.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TheFork is committed to a fair recruitment process. If you have special needs and require reasonable support during your application,&amp;nbsp; interview, or participation in the selection process due to health conditions or disability, please direct your inquiries to AccessibleRecruitment@TheFork.com. Our HR team will review the request and respond accordingly.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LL-MA1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Movement and Champion Restaurant Culture! 💚&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TheFork we believe that the best things in life happen around the table. &lt;br&gt;As the leading restaurant booking platform in Europe, we connect the broadest community of loyal diners with the world’s favorite restaurants. Powered by innovation and a deep passion for the restaurant industry, we create unique dining experiences across 11 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re part of the Tripadvisor Group and proud to be building a diverse, people-first culture where “respect”, “ownership”, “growth” and “better together” values thrive. &lt;br&gt;If you’re passionate about food, technology, and making a real impact, your seat at the table is ready.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.careers.thefork.com&quot;&gt; Discover life at TheFork&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make outbound to our current customers to present them solutions for their business to ensure they will generate significantly more revenue with TheFork month over month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support, mainly through email and phone, our Restaurants customers and help them with their positioning strategy, revenue management and online marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling, upselling and retaining products and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the primary point of contact and build long-term relationships with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the support and training to use our tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Your KPIs will include (but will not be limited to) and are subject to change based on business needs:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upselling and retention of products and partners on your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the usage of TheFork tools so restaurants are more engaged with customers and bookings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Number and quality of restaurants participating in TheFork Festival.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Must Meet These Critical Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as sales representative or account manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C2 level of Portuguese and fluent English is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in pitching and selling promotions/deals/flash sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in dealing with a high number (45-50) of outbound and inbound calls and portfolios with numerous accounts (from 400 to 800).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-oriented professional with strong empathy, communication skills, and a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic, resilient, and highly focused on achieving key result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Can Impress With These Additions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in restaurant operations and high-standard hospitality service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in e-commerce management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;😄&lt;/strong&gt; An awesome team (not everybody like our jokes, but we try our best)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏠 A Permanent contract (that can be useful in life)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ Flexible working environment (2 days home office per week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 Competitive fixed salary, bonus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍕 Lunch vouchers available for each working day (because yes, we like to try our best restaurants)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 International teams - More than 30 nationalities and over 10 offices worldwide&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏳️‍🌈 Highly inclusive working environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤸‍♀️ Lifestyle benefits that can be used to reimburse physical, leisure activities, family support, travel etc&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 Continuous learning and development programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😌 Free access to the Calm app&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🐣Dedicated parental leave and caregiver leave policies (12 weeks fully paid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏳ A program dedicated to help you have the best work/life balance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health insurance fully covered by the company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👩‍🦽 Life Insurance and Disability at no cost to the employee&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👴 Attractive pension plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 Amazing offices with dining, coffee point on each floor, and leisure area&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎤 Team building events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All hiring happens through our careers site and official email. We do not text or ask for payment during the hiring process. Please report any suspicious messages immediately.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that we are better together, and we welcome you for who you are. We endeavor to ensure&amp;nbsp; that everyone - regardless of ability, age, socio-economic &amp;amp; cultural background, ethnicity, faith, gender, gender expression, gender identity, ideology, national origin, race, sexual orientation, marital status, or any characteristic protected under&amp;nbsp; applicable law -has the opportunity to reach their full potential. At TheFork, we want you to bring us your unique perspectives and experiences, so we can collectively continue disrupting the restaurant industry and go from good to great.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TheFork is committed to a fair recruitment process. If you have special needs and require reasonable support during your application,&amp;nbsp; interview, or participation in the selection process due to health conditions or disability, please direct your inquiries to AccessibleRecruitment@TheFork.com. Our HR team will review the request and respond accordingly.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MA1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Quality Lead | Tripadvisor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tripadvisor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Tripadvisor Group connects people to experiences worth sharing, and aims to be the world’s most trusted source for travel and experiences. We leverage our brands, technology, and capabilities to connect our global audience with partners through rich content, travel guidance, and two-sided marketplaces for experiences, accommodations, restaurants, and other travel categories. The subsidiaries of Tripadvisor, Inc. (Nasdaq: TRIP), include a portfolio of travel brands and businesses, including Tripadvisor, Viator, and TheFork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Job Location: Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is a hybrid position that requires 1-2 days per week in our London office.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are seeking a detail-oriented &lt;strong&gt;AI QA Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to monitor, test, and evaluate our AI-driven customer experiences to ensure effortless, accurate, and scalable support for all our customers. This role focuses on the end-to-end quality of the customer support journey - from Self-Service and AI-Assist through to Human-Assist transitions. Ideal for a hands-on quality specialist with strong process validation experience, this role bridges customer feedback with technical tuning to continuously improve response accuracy, system compliance, and overall resolution quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Framework &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute QA frameworks, test scripts, and evaluation criteria specifically for AI chatbots, automated workflows, and agent copilot tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously audit and analyze real-time AI conversations and self-service flows to identify intent misclassifications, hallucinations, inaccurate answers, or broken customer journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closed-Loop Quality Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify root causes of AI accuracy failures and customer friction; feed actionable insights directly back to AI Automation Leads, Product, and Engineering teams for sprint training and fine-tuning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Human-Assist QA Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Audit the handover from AI to Human-Assist to ensure context retention, CRM integration accuracy, and seamless agent workflow execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benchmarking &amp;amp; Accuracy Scoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and report on key QA metrics, including intent recognition accuracy, resolution precision, containment effectiveness, and compliance standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Validation &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct pre-release user acceptance testing (UAT) and regression testing for all new AI prompt deployments, KB updates, and workflow releases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Defect &amp;amp; Gap Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with operational teams to identify recurring knowledge base gaps and out-of-scope customer queries to broaden AI coverage safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;QA or Process Improvement specialist with 2+ years of experience in customer contact-center operations or tech support environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience in testing or auditing AI conversational flows, chatbots, virtual assistants, or automated workflow tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with process improvement methodologies (e.g., Lean, Six Sigma) applied to quality control and operational auditing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
