&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Movement and Champion Restaurant Culture! 💚&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TheFork we believe that the best things in life happen around the table. &lt;br&gt;As the leading restaurant booking platform in Europe, we connect the broadest community of loyal diners with the world’s favorite restaurants. Powered by innovation and a deep passion for the restaurant industry, we create unique dining experiences across 11 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re part of the Tripadvisor Group and proud to be building a diverse, people-first culture where “respect”, “ownership”, “growth” and “better together” values thrive. &lt;br&gt;If you’re passionate about food, technology, and making a real impact, your seat at the table is ready.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.careers.thefork.com&quot;&gt; Discover life at TheFork&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a creative, forward-thinking&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;B2B Marketing Content &amp;amp; AI Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Central B2B Marketing team. If you love storytelling and are obsessed with figuring out how AI can make content production faster and smarter, this role is for you. You will play a pivotal role in accelerating our content pipeline and scaling our organic and paid campaigns across Meta, LinkedIn and other B2B channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will assist the central marketing team in moving from ideation to execution at lightning speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Content Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Use GenAI tools (like ChatGPT, Claude, Midjourney, Jasper, or similar) to brainstorm, draft, and iterate on high-quality B2B content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Media Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Draft compelling copy, hooks, and visual prompts for paid and organic campaigns on &lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Meta&lt;/strong&gt; (Facebook/Instagram).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Scaling &amp;amp; Repurposing:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn long-form assets (webinars, whitepapers, case studies) into bite-sized social posts, carousels, and short-form video scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Asset Prompting:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with design teams or use AI image generators to create eye-catching visuals and ad creatives that convert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor engagement metrics on LinkedIn and Meta to understand what content resonates and iterate based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ideal Candidate: A digital native who bridges the gap between creative writing and prompt engineering. You don&#39;t just use AI to cut corners; you use it to elevate quality and speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Must Meet These Critical Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently pursuing a degree in Marketing, Communications, Journalism, Business, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tool Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with AI writing assistants, LLMs, or image generation tools for content creation (please showcase this in your application!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt; (B2B dynamics, professional tone) and &lt;strong&gt;Meta&lt;/strong&gt; (ad formats, engagement tactics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Copywriting:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong writing skills with the ability to adapt tone of voice for a professional B2B audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive &amp;amp; Agile:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable experimenting with new tools, workflows, and fast-paced creative iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in English. Spanish, French &amp;amp; Italian are nice to have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this means for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You won&#39;t just be fetching coffee; you will actively shape our B2B content strategy and AI workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cutting-Edge Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a portfolio showcasing how to responsibly and effectively scale B2B marketing using AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with seasoned B2B marketers in a supportive, innovative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😄 An awesome team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏠 A six-month internship agreement starting in September&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ Flexible working environment (2 days home office per week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 Paid internship&lt;/p&gt;
