&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;You worked in a localization, UX writing, transcreation, translation, content design, or related role within a global ecommerce or tech company. Experience in the travel industry is a significant plus.&lt;/p&gt;
