&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Job Location: Remote in the United Kingdom&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is a remote position in the United Kingdom. Occasional travel to company offices as necessary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As CRM Specialist for the CRM Operations team, you will play a critical role in executing Tripadvisor communications with members via commerce streams, member newsletters and content collection communications. The ideal candidate will have a combination of email marketing experience, project management skills and the ability to communicate effectively regarding project status and email analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities will include, but not be restricted to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production of email campaigns, app push notifications, and site banners/interstitials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within our marketing automation platforms to produce audiences, campaign logic, and templates based off of technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with translation requests (we send in many languages)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heavily test all work to preemptively catch bugs, plus approve work of teammates by following our QA process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist managers in ad-hoc projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Examples:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tripadvisor sends multiple highly visible emails each week. The emails go to tens of millions of people in many languages across the globe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This person will be producing and sending 3-5 campaigns each week. One aspect of this is creating templates by updating copy, images, links, etc. within our template editor tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus is on the execution of the email, push, and site marketing campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we seek:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous attention to detail with a clear, methodological approach to problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a CRM role in a high energy online environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates should have 2+ years of email production experience in a corporate setting, with a strong focus on B2C&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building campaigns in the customer engagement platform, Braze, is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable multi-tasking in a fast-paced environment, with the ability to manage large cross-functional projects and numerous weekly launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Patience and professionalism when more clarification is needed or requirements change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills that enable you to engage with senior leaders and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI tools to improve efficiency, quality, and decision-making in day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
