&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Movement and Champion Restaurant Culture! 💚&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TheFork we believe that the best things in life happen around the table. &lt;br&gt;As the leading restaurant booking platform in Europe, we connect the broadest community of loyal diners with the world’s favorite restaurants. Powered by innovation and a deep passion for the restaurant industry, we create unique dining experiences across 11 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re part of the Tripadvisor Group and proud to be building a diverse, people-first culture where “respect”, “ownership”, “growth” and “better together” values thrive. &lt;br&gt;If you’re passionate about food, technology, and making a real impact, your seat at the table is ready.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.careers.thefork.com&quot;&gt; Discover life at TheFork&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position offers a gross TTC annual salary range between 44.000€ and 50.000€, in line with the collective bargaining agreement and the company compensation philosophy. The final offer will reflect the candidate’s experience, qualifications, and the specific responsibilities of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As responsible for the business development for your designed area:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;After selecting in-scope restaurants based on marketing recommendations, you will organize and manage your agenda to pro-actively schedule meetings with the owners or responsibles. Your daily agenda will be composed of cold-calls, walk-in visits and pre organized meetings to present TheFork products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be in charge of proposing and selling the entire range of TheFork products and services building personalized offers based on the restaurant’s needs, including: promotions, advanced software tool, booking widgets installed on the restaurant website, training &amp;amp; marketing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will make them understand the opportunities, features and benefits of the TheFork Manager tool and affiliate them to TheFork network.-&amp;nbsp;You will keep on&amp;nbsp;following-up activities with the clients you engaged with until you close the deal and the restaurant is successfully published online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter, results-oriented person who loves to reach and exceed targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic person, used to work independently in fast-paced environments and with great organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curious and willing to learn enthusiast, who wants to grow and improve with us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A foodie with interest in digital, tech products and restaurants sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer oriented person with a strong commercial mindset and influencing skills, capable to convince and engage people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-performing professional with demonstrated business development experience, preferably in B2B and in restaurants/hospitality environments, comfortable in managing short-term negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good usage of pc and Google Suite are mandatory. CRM software experience is preferable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C2 level of Italian.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;English knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😄 An awesome team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
