&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Movement and Champion Restaurant Culture! 💚&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TheFork we believe that the best things in life happen around the table. &lt;br&gt;As the leading restaurant booking platform in Europe, we connect the broadest community of loyal diners with the world’s favorite restaurants. Powered by innovation and a deep passion for the restaurant industry, we create unique dining experiences across 11 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re part of the Tripadvisor Group and proud to be building a diverse, people-first culture where “respect”, “ownership”, “growth” and “better together” values thrive. &lt;br&gt;If you’re passionate about food, technology, and making a real impact, your seat at the table is ready.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.careers.thefork.com&quot;&gt; Discover life at TheFork&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor marketing budget execution across all countries, helping identify deviations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in improving and updating budgeting tools, reports, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and maintenance of monthly, quarterly, and yearly marketing investment plans in close collaboration with Central Finance and Marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to financial reporting and investment performance analysis to support data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate and timely recording of marketing expenses in the financial system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Must Meet These Critical Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a degree in Finance, Business Administration, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in Finance and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with spreadsheets (Excel or Google Sheets) and eager to develop advanced skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset, with attention to detail and data accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and Spanish (required); knowledge of French, or Italian is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Can Impress With These Additions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive, eager to learn, and enjoy working in a dynamic, international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about the intersection of Finance and Marketing and are motivated to understand how budgeting impacts strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are reliable, detail-oriented, and have strong analytical thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate integrity, listen actively, and are open to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;😄 An awesome team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏠 A six-month internship agreement starting in September / October&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ Flexible working environment (2 days home office per week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 Paid internship&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍕 Lunch vouchers available for each working day (because yes, we like to try our best restaurants)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 International teams and a multicultural environment spanning 10 offices across Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝Highly inclusive working environment&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 Amazing offices with dining, a coffee point on each floor, and leisure area&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎤 Team building events&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All hiring happens through our careers site and official email. We do not text or ask for payment during the hiring process. Please report any suspicious messages immediately.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that we are better together, and we welcome you for who you are. We endeavor to ensure&amp;nbsp; that everyone - regardless of ability, age, socio-economic &amp;amp; cultural background, ethnicity, faith, gender, gender expression, gender identity, ideology, national origin, race, sexual orientation, marital status, or any characteristic protected under&amp;nbsp; applicable law -has the opportunity to reach their full potential. At TheFork, we want you to bring us your unique perspectives and experiences, so we can collectively continue disrupting the restaurant industry and go from good to great.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TheFork is committed to a fair recruitment process. If you have special needs and require reasonable support during your application,&amp;nbsp; interview, or participation in the selection process due to health conditions or disability, please direct your inquiries to AccessibleRecruitment@TheFork.com. Our HR team will review the request and respond accordingly.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
