&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strategic Process Mapping: Partner with teams across the Supply organization to identify high-friction workflows, operational bottlenecks, and high-impact opportunities for AI and automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• AI-Driven Transformation: Translate emerging AI capabilities, including Generative AI, AI agents, copilots, workflow automation, and predictive analytics into scalable solutions that improve productivity, supplier experience, and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Solution Design &amp;amp; Automation: Design, prototype, and implement AI-powered solutions, automation that streamline workflows, eliminate manual effort, and enable teams to scale more effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Full-Lifecycle Ownership: Lead automation initiatives from discovery and business case development through implementation, adoption, measurement, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Cross-Functional Leadership: Partner with Product, Engineering, Data, Legal, Security, Compliance, and operational stakeholders to deliver scalable, secure, and sustainable AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI tools to improve efficiency, quality, and decision-making in day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to operate effectively with a global-first mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience in sales, marketing, operations, with a proven track record of driving process automation and operational transformation. At least 1+ years of experience focused on applied AI, Generative AI, or intelligent automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep AI &amp;amp; Automation Expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Strong understanding of LLM capabilities and limitations, AI agents, workflow automation, prompt engineering, and orchestration frameworks. Hands-on experience with enterprise AI tools and a proven ability to rapidly prototype and demonstrate working solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Translation:&lt;/strong&gt; A natural ability to bridge business challenges and technical solutions, translating operational needs into scalable AI and automation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relentless Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to influence stakeholders, drive adoption of new technologies, and execute complex initiatives across cross-functional teams in a matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Agility:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Highly analytical, comfortable with ambiguity, and energized by solving the company&#39;s hardest problems through experimentation, rapid iteration, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
