&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tripadvisor is looking for a senior software engineer to take this exciting opportunity to join our fast-moving partner &lt;br&gt;products group in the Hotels Product Engineering organization. In this role, you will help us build, upgrade, and sustain &lt;br&gt;successful products which support connections between the world&#39;s largest and most trusted travel site, visited by over 400 million&lt;br&gt; travelers each month, and the world&#39;s leading travel brands, from large OTAs to independent boutique chains. &lt;br&gt;These true web-scale products used by our partners support Tripadvisor&#39;s travelers with the information they need for the best guidance on their considered trips and dream vacations.
&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate for this position will have a broad set of web platform skills including confident &lt;br&gt;knowledge of integration using APIs and similar technologies used for products on the web. &lt;br&gt;The candidate will demonstrate solid experience in coding for scale, including effective use of AI tools, &lt;br&gt;and have a passionate interest in producing high quality code quickly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Location: Remote/Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
