&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership in driving major projects and actively participating in cross-functional teams in fast-paced, dynamic environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for high-quality execution, operations and overall team performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses strong analytical skills to identify risks early, mitigate issues and provide contingency plans&lt;/li&gt;
